---
title: Cucumber Relish
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Pickles & Jams
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@large cucumbers{12}
@green peppers{2}
@celery{2%large stalks}
@sugar{3%c}
@celery seed{1%tsp}
@large onions{4}
@hot red peppers{2}
@cider vinegar{3%c}
@turmeric{1/2%tsp}
@mustard seed{1%tsp}
@salt

Do not peel cucumbers. If seeds are too large, remove, but if they are small, leave them in. Put vegetables through a food chopper. Mix and sprinkle with a handful of salt. Let stand overnight. In the morning, drain. Add remaining ingredients to the vegetables and boil for 30 minutes. Put into sterilized jars and seal. Makes about 6 pints.
